# Copy to .env.local (dev) or set in the hosting dashboard (prod). Never commit real .env files.
#
# Base URL of the backend, WITHOUT a trailing slash and WITHOUT /api.
# - Dev: leave empty. Requests go to /api/... on the Vite dev server, which proxies them to
#   http://localhost:8080 (see vite.config.ts).
# - Prod: the backend's public URL, e.g. https://sellerdesk-api.onrender.com
#   The backend's FRONTEND_URL must be this frontend's URL (CORS + refresh cookie Origin check).
#
# Vite bakes VITE_* values into the JavaScript at build time: anyone can read them.
# Never put secrets here.
VITE_API_URL=
